      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "1. Read README.md / README_ja.md. Place the required models and copy examples/assets images to ComfyUI/input.\n2. Select original X2 Detail v1 in Prepare INT8 VAE. First execution converts; later executions reuse.\n3. The prepared X2 VAE is for DECODE only. Keep the original H3 video VAE for image conditioning.\n4. Select NVENC physical GPU index (default 0). Queue this workflow.\n544x960 sampling -> 1088x1920 output / 124 frames / 24 fps / 4 steps.\nMeasured near 60s on RTX 4070, not a universal speed guarantee.\nhttps://sayakabenchmark.pages.dev/"
      ],
      "title": "H3 X2 Stream / Read first",
      "color": "#243448",
      "bgcolor": "#34465d"
    }
